{"id":"26783ec9aa5bef2a","group":"43","path":"43/43-thm-mlnull-uniform-union.md","title":"统一 Martin-Löf 零覆盖的可数并","display":"thm-mlnull-uniform-union — 统一 Martin-Löf 零覆盖的可数并","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity","book_abbrev":"43","label":"43-thm-mlnull-uniform-union","aliases":["43-thm-mlnull-uniform-union"],"display":"thm-mlnull-uniform-union — 统一 Martin-Löf 零覆盖的可数并","depends_on":["[[43-df-cylinder]]","[[43-df-mltest]]","[[43-df-mlnull]]","[[43-df-effective-open]]","[[43-df-effective-coding]]"],"source_edition":"Downey–Hirschfeldt, draft 2007-07-28","source_location":"本次笔记内推导；未作为原书定理编号核验","source_scope":"local-supplement","verification_status":"proved-in-note","source_proof_checked":false},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"43"},{"key":"label","html":"43-thm-mlnull-uniform-union"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>43-thm-mlnull-uniform-union</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-mlnull-uniform-union — 统一 Martin-Löf 零覆盖的可数并"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"ab1ef7b1cac112c1\" href=\"?note=ab1ef7b1cac112c1\" title=\"43-df-cylinder\">43-df-cylinder</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"e738767b1d98289f\" href=\"?note=e738767b1d98289f\" title=\"43-df-mltest\">43-df-mltest</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"bac412ecea4b0262\" href=\"?note=bac412ecea4b0262\" title=\"43-df-mlnull\">43-df-mlnull</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"7d3f8d3dfdb54f27\" href=\"?note=7d3f8d3dfdb54f27\" title=\"43-df-effective-open\">43-df-effective-open</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"aa33e0ea8422ba2a\" href=\"?note=aa33e0ea8422ba2a\" title=\"43-df-effective-coding\">43-df-effective-coding</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Downey–Hirschfeldt, draft 2007-07-28"},{"key":"source_location","html":"本次笔记内推导；未作为原书定理编号核验"},{"key":"source_scope","html":"local-supplement"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"proved-in-note"},{"key":"source_proof_checked","html":"false"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal B=\\mathcal B(2^\\omega)\">\\(\\mathcal B=\\mathcal B(2^\\omega)\\)</span> 与公平硬币 Borel 概率测度 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mu\">\\(\\mu\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"ab1ef7b1cac112c1\" href=\"?note=ab1ef7b1cac112c1\" title=\"43-df-cylinder\">43-df-cylinder</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\langle\\cdot,\\cdot\\rangle:\\mathbb N^2\\to\\mathbb N\">\\(\\langle\\cdot,\\cdot\\rangle:\\mathbb N^2\\to\\mathbb N\\)</span> 采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"aa33e0ea8422ba2a\" href=\"?note=aa33e0ea8422ba2a\" title=\"43-df-effective-coding\">43-df-effective-coding</a> 的配对函数。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"N=(N_e)_{e\\in\\mathbb N}\\in\\mathcal P(2^\\omega)^{\\mathbb N}\">\\(N=(N_e)_{e\\in\\mathbb N}\\in\\mathcal P(2^\\omega)^{\\mathbb N}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"U=(U_{e,n})_{e,n\\in\\mathbb N}\\in\\mathcal B^{\\mathbb N^2}\">\\(U=(U_{e,n})_{e,n\\in\\mathbb N}\\in\\mathcal B^{\\mathbb N^2}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V\\in\\mathcal B^{\\mathbb N}\">\\(V\\in\\mathcal B^{\\mathbb N}\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{UniformEffectiveOpen}\">\\(\\mathrm{UniformEffectiveOpen}\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{MLNull}\">\\(\\mathrm{MLNull}\\)</span> 分别见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"7d3f8d3dfdb54f27\" href=\"?note=7d3f8d3dfdb54f27\" title=\"43-df-effective-open\">43-df-effective-open</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"bac412ecea4b0262\" href=\"?note=bac412ecea4b0262\" title=\"43-df-mlnull\">43-df-mlnull</a>。假设</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{UniformEffectiveOpen}(V)\\land\\forall e,n\\in\\mathbb N\\;V_{\\langle e,n\\rangle}=U_{e,n},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{UniformEffectiveOpen}(V)\\land\\forall e,n\\in\\mathbb N\\;V_{\\langle e,n\\rangle}=U_{e,n},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\forall e,n\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\mu(U_{e,n})\\le2^{-n},\\qquad\\forall e\\in\\mathbb N\\;N_e\\subseteq\\bigcap_{n\\in\\mathbb N}U_{e,n}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\forall e,n\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\mu(U_{e,n})\\le2^{-n},\\qquad\\forall e\\in\\mathbb N\\;N_e\\subseteq\\bigcap_{n\\in\\mathbb N}U_{e,n}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{MLNull}\\!\\left(\\bigcup_{e\\in\\mathbb N}N_e\\right).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{MLNull}\\!\\left(\\bigcup_{e\\in\\mathbb N}N_e\\right).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>二维统一性由配对后的单一有效开序列 V 明确给出，所有分量共享同一枚举过程；N、U、V 的函数域及测度调用域均已声明。</p>\n<p>取 W_n=⋃<em>eU</em>{e,n+e+1}，测度至多∑_e2<sup>{−n−e−1}=2</sup>{−n}。本逐层并构造的统一枚举使用前提中的二维统一性；W 与用于编码原数组的 V 分别命名。</p>\n<p>来源：本次笔记内推导；未作为原书定理编号核验。书内定位仅适用用户提供的2007-07-28草稿；本地补充另行注明。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"43-df-cylinder","status":"resolved","id":"ab1ef7b1cac112c1","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-cylinder]]","embe